{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-01-11 11:54:00', 'title': 'KETCHUM HIRES SAMANTHA SCHWARZ AS LEADER OF NORTH AMERICA HEALTH PORTFOLIO', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JAN. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0REFLECTING ITS REPUTATION AS A DESTINATION FOR TOP HEALTHCARE TALENT, LEADING COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY KETCHUM TODAY ANNOUNCED THE HIRES OF SAMANTHA SCHWARZ AS MANAGING DIRECTOR AND HEALTH PORTFOLIO LEADER TO LEAD ITS NORTH AMERICA HEALTH BUSINESS. SHE JOINS THE CONSULTANCY FROM NOVARTIS, WHERE SHE SERVED AS SENIOR DIRECTOR, CORPORATE COMMUNICATIONS, NOVARTIS GENE THERAPIES.'}